					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SPECTRUM IN\n\nThe Spectrum In node takes the FFT data from Resolume Arena or Avenue and makes it usable in Wire. This is a great tool for creating audio reactive patches. Check the Wire article on FFT on our website to learn how to set up FFT in Wire.\n\n"
