					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE\n\nIn this patch we take the FFT data from Arena or Avenue and we we create a simple frequency visualizer. \nWe use the Sequence node with the Read node the read every 8th signal coming in. \nThis is because we don't want to work with 1028 shapes as that would be very taxing on our machine. \nWe use in those values for the Y position of our tiny circles."
					}
